audio:
  lang: en
  lines:
    '|a||A twelfth Russian story: white nights':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3480
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||June in Petersburg: the sky stays light, the bridges over the Neva go up, and Masha and Tom are on the wrong side of the river. Eighteen lines to read and hear, then six questions by eye and by ear.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 15360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1plyejh'
    '|b||June in Petersburg, late at night. Tom and I are by the river. Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6520
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|b||Смотри́, мост разво́дят!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2200
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:mdqjt'
    '|a||А как мы пое́дем домо́й?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2200
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Ника́к! Бу́дем гуля́ть до утра́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3240
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|b||What does Masha point at?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1960
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|b||Смотри́, мост!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1760
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|b||What will they do now?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1920
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|b||Бу́дем гуля́ть до утра́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2040
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Бе́лые но́чи, white nights: in June the sky over Petersburg hardly gets dark.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6840
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||And at night, from spring to autumn, the bridges over the Neva go up to let the ships pass.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6200
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1rcqr7u'
    '|b||Мосты́ разво́дят: they raise the bridges.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2960
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1wywitg'
    '|b||Our night, in eighteen lines. Прочита́йте each page first, then I read it.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6240
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:n5xh9z'
    '|b||В ию́не Ма́ша прие́хала в Петербу́рг на бе́лые но́чи.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3880
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:6l6txq'
    '|b||Том рабо́тал с двух до десяти́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2120
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:knu51e'
    '|b||По́сле рабо́ты они́ гуля́ли на на́бережной Невы́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3160
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:kdkz7i'
    '|b||Хотя́ бы́ло уже́ по́здно, на у́лице бы́ло мно́го люде́й.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2920
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:n1gq7q'
    '|a||Да́льше: who else is out so late, and then a surprise.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:wof3ba'
    '|b||Там гуля́ли роди́тели с детьми́ и студе́нты.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3560
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:cpirsp'
    '|b||Кто́-то игра́л на гита́ре.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2040
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1anzxuy'
    '|b||Ма́ша купи́ла ко́фе для себя́ и для То́ма.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3320
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1yxztqe'
    '|b||Вдруг она́ сказа́ла: «Смотри́, мост разво́дят!»':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3880
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:s1i8iw'
    '|a||Для себя́: like для То́ма, the genitive.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3800
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1bzns7'
    '|a||Да́льше: so how do we get home now?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1lao52d'
    '|b||Все лю́ди смотре́ли на мост.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2320
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:bx2tiv'
    '|b||Том спроси́л, как они́ пое́дут домо́й.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2400
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:2vei0o'
    '|b||Метро́ не рабо́тало, а Том живёт на Васи́льевском о́строве.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3760
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:14dm4gl'
    '|b||«Ника́к! Бу́дем гуля́ть до утра́», — отве́тила Ма́ша.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3600
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1irhrkj'
    '|a||Да́льше: a long walk, and a lot of talk.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3920
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:15cxp1o'
    '|b||Они́ гуля́ли до утра́ и мно́го говори́ли.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3480
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1258hdy'
    '|b||Ма́ша спроси́ла, нра́вится ли Тому́ Петербу́рг.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3000
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1gwnsi9'
    '|b||«Рабо́ты мно́го, зато́ здесь бе́лые но́чи!» — отве́тил Том.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4760
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:g72kyx'
    '|a||Нра́вится ли: the verb, then ли. Whether he likes it.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4800
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:24sp9s'
    '|a||Да́льше: the morning, and the way home.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1prc2np'
    '|b||У́тром они́ взя́ли такси́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2120
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:4b9pev'
    '|b||Води́тель вёз их че́рез мост, а Ма́ша спала́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3640
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1543c4w'
    '|b||До́ма она́ сказа́ла: «Э́то была́ лу́чшая ночь!»':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3640
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1b1nvol'
    '|a||Шесть вопро́сов, then your score.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2800
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:5mt3pz'
    '|b||Рабо́ты мно́го, ___ здесь бе́лые но́чи!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3720
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1u6nvby'
    '|b||Lots of work, but on the other hand: white nights.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4200
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Two questions on one listen. Послу́шайте: the taxi, in the morning.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7120
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Том, куда́ мы е́дем?':
